# Universal CL SKU match

Against **Custom Label** (entire cell, casefold), try in order and stop on first hit:

1. Whole Item SKU
2. After first `-`
3. Till last dash (everything before the last `-`)

Implementation: `shared/cl_sku_match.py`. Do not invent a different order per app.
